cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "KPI dashboard"
abstract: >-
  A Streamlit dashboard for tracking the work of a small analysis/consulting
  team: a personal time log, a project tracker with turnaround metrics, a
  goals/ratings view for longer-running initiatives, and a tools inventory,
  plus a static, read-only snapshot exporter.
